WEBVTT

00:04:27.399 --> 00:04:30.087
in preprosto mi ni jasno

00:04:30.087 --> 00:04:33.880
zakaj so naokoli posadili 
samo bodičaste rastline. (Smeh)

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.969
Rekli smozdravnikom: "Lahko
prevzamemo urejanje teh površin?"

00:04:36.969 --> 00:04:39.323
Rekli so: "Seveda, 
a potrebujete dovoljenje,

00:04:39.323 --> 00:04:41.245
biti mora v latinici in v treh izvodih".

00:04:41.245 --> 00:04:44.035
To smo storili--(Smeh)--
in zdaj okoli medicinskega centra

00:04:44.035 --> 00:04:47.330
raste sadno drevje,

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.560
grmičevje, zelišča in zelenjava,

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.836
In še mnogo je takih primerov, 
kot denimo koruza

00:04:52.836 --> 00:04:54.692
pred policijsko postajo,

00:04:54.692 --> 00:04:56.269
pri domu za ostarele

00:04:56.269 --> 00:04:58.481
smo zasadili hrano, 
ki jo obirajo in gojijo.

00:04:58.481 --> 00:05:00.191
Vendar ne gre se samo za gojenje,